		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Start with a modular monolith. It keeps deployment simple while you learn where real boundaries sit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Add managed queues and caching where latency or burst traffic demands it, and automate infrastructure with code so environments stay reproducible.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Finally, observe everything: logs, metrics and traces are what turn an outage from a mystery into a ten-minute fix.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
